<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rdf:RDF xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:vcard="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#">
    <dcat:Catalog>
        <dcat:dataset>
            <dcat:Dataset>
                <dct:description xml:lang="kr">경상남도 진주시 소재의 음식점에 대한 데이터를 제공합니다.<br/><br/>* 제공 정보 내용 : 연번, 시도, 시군구, 업종명, 소재지(도로명, 지번), 전화번호, 데이터기준일<br/>* 업종 : 일반음식점, 휴게음식점<br/>* 데이터 현행화 주기 : 연간<br/>* 파일 내 업종의 정의는 식품위생법 시행령 제21조(영업의 종류)를 참고해 주시기 바랍니다.<br/> <br/>- 2026년 8월 18일자 기준, 음식점 정보 데이터 건수는 6,691건입니다.<br/><br/>* 식품접객업소의 현황은 진주시청 홈페이지에서 열람 가능합니다. (매월 초 업데이트)<br/>- 정보소재 : 진주시청 홈페이지 식품관련업소현황 검색 또는 진주시청홈페이지-진주소개-실과안내-문화관광체육국-위생과-식품관련 업소 현황<br/> (https://www.jinju.go.kr/00135/01112/05121.web)<br/><br/>* 경상남도 진주시 관광 음식점 안내 관련은 진주시청 홈페이지-진주관광 탭에서 확인 가능합니다.<br/>- 정보소재 : 진주시청 홈페이지-진주관광-음식, 숙박, 쇼핑-음식점<br/> (https://www.jinju.go.kr/02234/02349/02354.web)<br/>- 제공 내용 : 진주의 전통맛집(비빔밥, 냉면, 장어, 전통 한정식 등), 진주의 일반맛집, 위생등급 지정업소,  안심식당, 진주빵아요<br/>  ** 진주빵아요는 진주 빵 맛집을 표시한 지도 및 업체목록(업체명, 소재지, 전화번호, 대표메뉴)을 볼 수 있습니다.</dct:description>
                <dct:description xml:lang="en">Provides data on restaurants located in Jinju, Gyeongsangnam-do.<br/><br/> * Provided information: Serial number, City/Province, City/County/District, Business type, Location (Road name, Lot number), Phone number, Data reference date<br/> * Business Type: General Restaurant, Rest Stop Restaurant<br/> * Data Update Cycle: Annual<br/> Please refer to Article 21 (Types of Business) of the Enforcement Decree of the Food Sanitation Act for the definitions of business types within the file.<br/><br/> - As of August 18, 2026, the number of restaurant information data records is 6,691.<br/><br/> The current status of food service establishments is available on the Jinju City Hall website. (Updated at the beginning of every month)<br/> - Source: Search for "Status of Food-Related Businesses" on the Jinju City Hall website or Jinju City Hall website - About Jinju - Department Guide - Culture, Tourism and Sports Bureau - Sanitation Division - Status of Food-Related Businesses<br/> (https://www.jinju.go.kr/00135/01112/05121.web)<br/><br/> Information regarding tourist restaurants in Jinju, Gyeongsangnam-do is available on the Jinju City Hall website under the Jinju Tourism tab.<br/> - Source: Jinju City Hall Website - Jinju Tourism - Food, Accommodation, Shopping - Restaurants<br/> (https://www.jinju.go.kr/02234/02349/02354.web)<br/> - Contents Provided: Jinju's Traditional Restaurants (Bibimbap, Naengmyeon, Eel, Traditional Hanjeongsik, etc.), Jinju's General Restaurants, Hygiene Grade Designated Establishments, Safe Restaurants, Jinju Bbang-ayo<br/> ** Jinjuppang-ayo allows you to view a map marking famous bakeries in Jinju and a list of businesses (business name, location, phone number, signature menu).</dct:description>
                <dct:title xml:lang="kr">경상남도 진주시_음식점정보</dct:title>
                <dct:title xml:lang="en">Jinju City, Gyeongsangnam-do_Restaurant Information</dct:title>
                <dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-08-18</dct:issued>
                <dct:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-08-18</dct:modified>
                <dct:publisher>
                    <foaf:Organization>
                        <foaf:name>경상남도 진주시</foaf:name>
                        
                    </foaf:Organization>
                </dct:publisher>
                <dcat:contactPoint>
                    <vcard:Organization>
                        <vcard:organization-unit>위생과</vcard:organization-unit>
                        <vcard:hasTelephone rdf:resource="055-749-8345"/>
                    </vcard:Organization>
                </dcat:contactPoint>
                <dct:conformsTo ></dct:conformsTo>
                <dcat:theme>문화체육관광 - 관광</dcat:theme>
                <dcat:keyword xml:lang="kr">일반음식점,휴게음식점,식당,식품,위생,음식점</dcat:keyword>
                <dcat:keyword xml:lang="en">General restaurant, rest stop restaurant, restaurant, food, hygiene, food establishment</dcat:keyword>
                <dct:rights>이용허락범위 제한 없음</dct:rights>
                <dct:accrualPeriodicity>연간</dct:accrualPeriodicity>
                
                <dcat:landingPage rdf:resource="https://www.data.go.kr/data/3074831/fileData.do"/>
                <dcat:distribution>
                    <dcat:Distribution>
                        <dct:accessURL ></dct:accessURL>
                        <dcat:description></dcat:description>
                        <dcat:format>csv</dcat:format>
                        <dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2026-08-18</dct:issued>
                        <dcat:title>경상남도 진주시_음식점정보_20260818</dcat:title>
                    </dcat:Distribution>
                </dcat:distribution>
                <dct:spatial></dct:spatial>
                <dct:temporal></dct:temporal>
            </dcat:Dataset>
        </dcat:dataset>

